<title>USA: TABLE-Telefonica de Argentina Q3 shr $0.04.</title>
<headline>TABLE-Telefonica de Argentina Q3 shr $0.04.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-08-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>(In millions, except per share, ADS data)</p>
<p>					For the period April to June</p>
<p>					    1997		 1996</p>
<p> Net sales/revenues	    $   714.3	  $   666.1</p>
<p> Operating income		    208.0		167.1</p>
